ure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":986056,\"title\":\"Thunderbolts*\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hqcexYHbiTBfDIdDWxrxPtVndBX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rthMuZfFv4fqEU4JVbgSW9wQ8rs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After finding themselves ensnared in a death trap, seven disillusioned castoffs must embark on a dangerous mission that will force them to confront the darkest corners of their pasts.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1041360,\"title\":\"Olimpo, Andalucía\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/di6Ta8oSDvEbAieHE9RmQjmZGJi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9HangqB5RzcTnclUDmAHKUSarm2.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a 'neo-quinqui' Andalusia plagued by superheroes and villains, the paths of a couple with superhuman strength and a criminal organization with highly developed technology collide spectacularly.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1271,\"title\":\"300\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h7Lcio0c9ohxPhSZg42eTlKIVVY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgBZlJ1LHQel5nneNQMoesmvc7l.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A story very loosely based the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, where the King of Sparta led his army against the advancing Persians.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268673,\"title\":\"Kamen Rider Agito: Project G4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Ib5YCu3opbGlO8YuQ30tVRYnuc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJJ2Ba4n1bLl51gOb2YzPXb0m1h.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shouichi encounters a teenage girl called Sayaka, who ran away from a military facility because of an attack by the Ant Lords. Sayaka has a supernatural ability to foresee the future. Risa Fukami, of the military group GA, wants to use that power to enhance the newly-made G4 System, which was based upon designs stolen from Ozawa.  Now, Agito and Gills must fight to stop the Ant Lords' attack, as G3 and G4 settle their score.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2080,\"title\":\"X-Men Origins: Wolverine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yj8LbTju1p7CUJg7US2unSBk33s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p4GzAzjlL7lXIVGvayg7zvzGTSi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"ov